Parents and guardians should supervise the photos captured, selected, saved, or shared through the app.

Users should not include sensitive personal information, identification documents, private locations, or other confidential content in gameplay photos.

If the developer becomes aware that personal information from a child has been collected in a manner inconsistent with applicable law, reasonable steps will be taken to investigate and appropriately address the issue.

